<Base title="About" description="Industrial engineer by training, and a pilot. Went into consulting, then banking, then big-tech product, and then back to school for a PhD so that I could teach.">
  <header class="page-head">
    <h1>About</h1>
    <div class="grid"><div class="span-8">
      <p>Industrial engineer by training, and a pilot. Went into consulting, then banking, then big-tech product, and then back to school for a PhD <mark>so that I could teach</mark>.</p>
    </div></div>
  </header>

  <Section label="Education">
    <div class="kv">
      <p class="label">2019–2025</p><p>PhD, Management Science and Engineering, University of Waterloo. Thesis in human-computer interaction: <em>Towards Design of Interaction Systems for Constrained Spaces</em>. Supervisor: Mark Hancock.</p>
      <p class="label">2010–2012</p><p>MS, Engineering Management Systems, Columbia University. Graduate student speaker at Columbia Engineering commencement.</p>
      <p class="label">2006–2010</p><p>BTech, Industrial Engineering, National Institute of Technology, Jalandhar.</p>
    </div>
  </Section>

  <Section label="Awards and funding">
    <div class="kv">
      <p class="label">2025</p><p>Queen Elizabeth II Graduate Scholarship in Science and Technology</p>
      <p class="label">2024</p><p>Aapoolcoyuz Biman Memorial Graduate Scholarship in Engineering</p>
      <p class="label">2023–2024</p><p>Ontario Graduate Scholarship</p>
      <p class="label">2022–2025</p><p>President's Graduate Scholarship, University of Waterloo</p>
      <p class="label">Ongoing</p><p>Outstanding reviewer recognition, CHI, CSCW, and CUI</p>
    </div>
  </Section>

  <Section label="Service">
    <div class="kv">
      <p class="label">2023</p><p>Local Arrangements Chair, CHI PLAY 2023</p>
      <p class="label">2023</p><p>Program Committee, Understanding and Evaluating UX Outcomes at Scale, CSCW 2023 workshop</p>
      <p class="label">2021–2022</p><p>Elected member, Equity, Diversity, and Inclusion Committee, Waterloo Games Institute</p>
      <p class="label">2021–</p><p>Board member, a venture fund; formerly treasurer of a nonprofit sailing club</p>
    </div>
  </Section>

  <Section label="Flying">
    <div class="grid"><div class="span-8 flying">
      <ul>
        <li>Commercial pilot, Transport Canada and FAA</li>
        <li>FAA instrument rating and ground instructor</li>
